<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 74-3 AT TEA V AUSTRALIA (118).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 74-3 AT TEA V AUSTRALIA (118).</headline>
<dateline>LONDON, England 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 74-3 in their first innings at lunch, on the first day of their five day test match against Australia on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 118 all out, England 74-3.</p>
</text>
